{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/189","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/189/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/189/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/189/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/189","id":5911627645,"node_id":"I_kwDOT06kyc8AAAABYFxHfQ","number":189,"title":"GET_RX_STATE REGISTERING_FAILED stays 0 after an in-place Talker Advertise to Talker Failed swap","user":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-10-18T16:26:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:12:31Z","closed_at":"2026-10-20T11:12:31Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found by the in-house qualification run of 2026-10-18 on the AX7101 (dev e9cbb676, processor 2cbed0a9).\n\n**Behaviour.**\n- The talker replaces its Talker Advertise by a Talker Failed in place: one declaration, with no Leave in between.\n- After that, GET_STREAM_INFO reports REGISTERING and REGISTERING_FAILED, and the DUT declares Listener Asking Failed.\n- But GET_RX_STATE keeps REGISTERING_FAILED at 0 (flags 0x0002).\n- With a fresh Talker Failed registration, both commands report it correctly.\n\n**Required.**\n- Milan v1.2 5.5.3.5.44, Table 5.39: REGISTERING_FAILED is \"1 if registering a Talker Failed attribute\". See also Table 5.23.\n- IEEE 802.1Q-2018 35.2.6: a declaration-type change is the new declaration alone.\n\n**Source.**\n- `hdl/acmp/KL_pp_acmp_listener.sv:1158-1161` latches the Talker-Failed bit only on an EVT_TK_REGISTERED that hits a valid, non-ignored cell. In SETTLED_RSV_OK that event is a don't-care (Milan v1.2 Table 5.30), so the in-place swap's strobe is dropped.\n- `:652` and `:694` drive the GET_RX_STATE flag from that bit.\n\n**Done when:**\n- GET_RX_STATE's REGISTERING_FAILED follows the registered declaration type on every change, including the in-place swap in both directions, with no state transition added;\n- a suite case and a planted mutant cover it;\n- the processor's suites and the parent's consumer gates pass.\n","closed_by":{"login":"Mister-M-alt","id":161579364,"node_id":"U_kgDOCaGBZA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161579364?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt","html_url":"https://github.com/Mister-M-alt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mister-M-alt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/189/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mister-M-alt/protocol-processor-control-plane-avb-milan/issues/189/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}